WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:05.690
<i>As the Dark Realm's Number 2, 
Jahy-sama is the strongest,</i>

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:11.690
<i>most ruthless, most feared entity...</i>

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.140
<i>or was.</i>

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.620
Freaking... Magical Girl!

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.310
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.100
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:44.890
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:45.600
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.390
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:48.270
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:03.510
<b>Restoration Plan No. 6

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:06.060
<i>All this time, I've been collecting the 
mana crystals to restore the Dark Realm.</i>

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:11.510
<i>But now that she showed 
up, everything changed!</i>

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:20.830
It's not just about collecting 
the mana crystals anymore.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.120
I also have to keep them safe from her.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:29.120
W-Well, the other time I was just 
in bad shape because of my cold!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.890
I'm not afraid of her!

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:31.750
Maho—

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:36.030
<i>Magical Girl?!</i>

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:38.940
...chan, you're so amazing!

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:42.090
What? No, I'm not that great.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.980
Sheesh, get a different name!

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:49.540
Maho—

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.000
Mahogany!

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.420
If it's wooden furniture, 
it's got to be mahogany.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.130
Now it's just getting weird!

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:02.450
Maho...

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:05.680
Mahoroba, neverending...

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.630
Mahoroba, neverending...

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.460
Stop scaring me!

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.090
What are you so freaked out about?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.240
The Magical Girl is nothing!

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.570
I'm not scared of her!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.090
In fact, she can come at me anytime!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.390
I won't run or hide!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:24.300
Magical Girl!

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:27.470
That's Gyua Bravo from 
<i>Hagyutto Gyua Gyua</i>, right?!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:30.560
She is <i>the</i> Magical Girl.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.900
<i>A different Magical Girl, then.</i>

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.280
<i>Phew.</i>

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:37.750
<i>No, I need to stop!</i>

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.780
<i>Why am I relieved?!</i>

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.140
Oh, a dog god!

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:43.880
What's a dog god?

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.450
You don't know?

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.520
Well, it's when a family...

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.490
Uh huh...

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:50.000
<i>If anything, this is a good thing!</i>

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.160
<i>This time I can get her back 
for destroying the Dark Realm.</i>

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:54.490
<i>That's it!</i>

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:57.160
<i>Next time I'll use this mana 
crystal to return to my true form</i>

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.800
<i>and challenge her to the next round!</i>

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.640
<i>And then I'll beat her black and blue;</i>

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:04.540
<i>I'll make her tremble in fear and terror!</i>

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:07.720
<i>I'll make her rue the day 
she ever stood against me.</i>

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.780
So, did you see the Magical Girl?

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.020
<i>Magical Girl is scary! She's so scary!</i>

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.780
<i>I lied, she's scary!</i>

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.760
You mean, that old guy who does cosplay?

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:25.770
Yeah! He's so muscular!

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:27.820
His beard was amazing!

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:29.210
Right?!

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:38.040
Pyrica Pumple Magical Power!

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:40.510
That bearded one from the other day!

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:42.880
Not you again!

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.750
Now that I'm all calmed down, I'm hungry.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.460
Where's the... mana crystal?

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.650
Did I drop it? Did I lose it?

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:03.230
But that's...

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:07.710
Without it I can't restore the 
Dark Realm or defeat Magical Girl...

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:12.210
Hy-chan?

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.080
I knew that was you.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.000
You dropped your mana crystal.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:25.620
I'm so relieved!

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.750
Oh, my heart can't take any more...

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:29.760
Thank you, thank you.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:30.930
Are you all right?

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:32.740
I was worried.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:37.390
I heard that you've been really 
terrified since that incident.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:41.770
T-T-T-Terrified? Never!

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:45.530
I really, really, really... wasn't, though!

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:49.420
Even when I was assaulted by the 
one who destroyed the Dark Realm,

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:52.530
almost had my mana crystal taken 
from me with her overwhelming power,

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:53.790
I was never scared!

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:59.750
Don't bottle it all up inside, Hy-chan.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.480
Maybe we're not able to be of much help,

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.550
but you can always come to us, you know?

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.230
<i>Boss...</i>

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:16.310
In the Dark Realm,

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:19.710
I clawed my way up to Number 2 all 
by myself. Everyone feared me.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:24.910
But ever since I've fallen 
into the human world...

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:27.720
I've been a mess.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.780
This is why I've not made it further.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.390
I won't depend on you!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.290
Mind your own business!

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.460
Hy-chan, wait!

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.550
Hy-chan, don't go!

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:46.200
Hy-chan...

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:49.880
You really should take a bath right away.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:52.380
You smell like hot garbage!

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:54.370
Mind your own business!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.640
No more wearing trash cans.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.820
I know that!

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:04.860
Sniff, sniff.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:17.370
A mana crystal!

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:18.590
Finally!

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:20.080
I finally found one!

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.630
With that one, I won't need 
to be scared of Magical Girl.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:26.210
I'll be one step closer to 
restoring the Dark Realm!

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.420
Even better, some weak-looking 
girl is holding it!

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:32.010
This is my lucky day!

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.840
Hey! You there, girl!

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:38.450
That mana crystal isn't for the 
likes of a puny human like you.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:41.420
You'd do best to present it to me!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.900
You're...

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.730
You came to me.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.250
It's so great, this is so much easier.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.330
What are you talking about?

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:59.580
It's no surprise that you didn't notice.

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:02.790
I don't really like 
transforming in town, but...

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:06.630
What about now?

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:16.220
M-Magical Girl?!

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:21.890
So, this time, can I have that mana crystal?

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:25.860
<i>It's over!</i>

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.190
Let me...

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:35.830
have it...!

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:46.420
The mana crystal!

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:54.720
Oh, my hand slipped!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.950
Give it... here...

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.040
Haha!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.860
You weren't much, now were you?

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:17.810
So I guess the Magical Girl was 
nothing but an ordinary human!

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:21.700
Nothing to be scared of. 
She's no enemy of mi—

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:23.220
Do not worry!

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:24.580
I'm just fine!

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:30.110
I've trained so I won't 
succumb to misfortune!

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.250
Is that really something you can train for?

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:37.680
Right now, I've spared someone 
misfortune by bearing it myself.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:40.430
Just thinking about it...

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:43.390
makes me tingle!

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.140
I don't want to know that?!

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:48.260
Come now, give me that mana crystal, too!

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:49.550
Fool!

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:51.070
If you hold more mana crystals,

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:52.900
great misfortune will befall even you!

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:53.820
I don't care!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.500
I'll shoulder all the misfortune!

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:57.900
Let me have it!

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.830
<i>She's really broken!</i>

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:04.440
Let go! Let go!

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:05.910
If you don't stop, you'll di—

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:11.130
Not enough! More! Bring it!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.840
My hand slipped again!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.160
And again...

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:36.840
Poke... Poke, poke.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:48.990
So did I... win?

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:56.950
You freaked me out!

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.440
Revenge for the Dark Realm!

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:00.430
Revenge for the Demon King!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:03.890
Take that!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.600
How is it? This is how terrifying I am!

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.350
Did you learn your lesson?!

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:10.600
That's what you get for underestimating 
the mana crystal's misfortune!

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:14.620
Huh?

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:36.300
You're the one underestimating me.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.060
This is amount of misfortune is nothing!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:42.110
What the...

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.470
Oh! My mana crystal!

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:49.680
Nobody is more familiar with the 
mana crystal's misfortune than me.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:52.640
I'll take on this mana crystal, as well!

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.020
Farewell!

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:02.590
This... can't be real.

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:06.540
My...

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.200
My mana crystal...

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.500
<b>Craft
Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.500
You're drinking too much Hy-chan.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.580
Another!

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:20.860
I think you've had enough.

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:21.670
Shut up!

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.700
How am I supposed to get 
through this without a drink?

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.610
I'm the Number 2 of the Dark Realm!

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.300
I finally gathered that 
huge chunk of mana crystal.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.850
How could that little girl take it from me?!

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:36.240
There, there...

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:38.060
You'll find it again.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.770
But is drinking this much really okay?

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:45.030
This is nothing!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:47.190
You can really hold your liquor.

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:49.530
Don't you compare me to a measly human.

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:52.110
You think this much is 
going to do anything to me?

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:55.430
I used my powers to turn into 
my true form for drinking!

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:02.650
It's a good thing I didn't have my 
original mana crystal taken.

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:08.250
I don't even want to think about what 
would happen if both were stolen.

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:10.680
Damn it!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:15.740
Back in the Dark Realm, I was the 
only one the Demon King acknowledged,

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:19.040
the only one who was allowed 
to rule in his place!

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.690
That's right.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.560
There was nobody who could best me!

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:28.160
I was the one and only great Jahy!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.660
And now... now... Why?!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.600
I am the Dark Realm's Number 2!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.760
Chin up!

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:38.850
That's not much different from you now.

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:42.500
Here in the Pub Maou, 
you're the one and only employee!

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:47.760
That's not the same! 
Not the same at all!

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.260
Isn't it though?

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:53.390
Hey, Sis, I thought you were closed today.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.280
Landlord!

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:57.670
Damn, you're drunk.

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:00.650
Anyway, if you've got money to drink, 
you've got money to pay your rent!

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:03.730
Like hell I will! Come drink!

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:09.530
You won't drink my booze, huh?!

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:12.490
Yikes. What a pain in the ass.

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:14.910
Hey, Sis. Pour me one, too.

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.400
All right! Drink up!

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:18.280
Ryou-chan, I don't know about this...

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.840
<b>Craft </b>Pub

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.840
<b>Maou.</b>

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:27.410
I wasn't like this back in the Dark Realm.

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:29.760
I just cut down anyone who went against me.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.970
Not that there was anyone 
who dared to do that.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.060
I really was something 
back in the Dark Realm!

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:39.720
During rush hour, your cash register 
skills are really something, too!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.020
It's not the same at all!

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:44.680
I was so, so, so much better!

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:50.530
I was really great, right?

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:54.970
I never made a mistake, right?

00:14:55.920 --> 00:15:00.500
Since I've come here, 
I've been making money to live off,

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.500
Welcome!

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:02.740
done housework,

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:09.130
set up a life... so I could 
restore the Dark Realm.

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:22.450
I've been trying so hard!

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:25.650
Then I finally found one...

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.980
struggled to make it mine...

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:31.840
and then the Magical Girl just 
stole it from me like that.

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:37.380
What... What... What...

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:41.920
do I even do now?!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.160
Hy-chan...

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:51.640
I'm trying so hard to restore the Dark Realm

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.020
<i>Hy-chan...</i>

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:51.930
<i>Oh, no, I've let her drink too much.</i>

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:55.800
but why am I so useless?!

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:59.630
You're doing good, Ja-ko.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.230
Land...lord?

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:05.780
I dunno about no Dark Realm.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.900
But you came to this foreign 
place all by yourself.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:12.350
Ann you're working, making money, 
working, making money...

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:15.910
I can't do anyting withou my shister!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:16.900
Anyway!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:20.120
Ja-ko, I'm proud of you!

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.950
Landlord!

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:34.760
Am I really doing good?

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:36.220
You are!

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:37.930
Am I... amazing?

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:38.890
You are amazing!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.600
Am I... smart?

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:41.810
Like a fox!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.340
Am I... cool?

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:44.360
So cool!

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:45.590
Am I ...strong?

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:46.490
Stwong!

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:47.940
Am I the best?

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.270
Bestest!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.360
Do you like me?

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:55.240
I do!

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.520
Landlord!

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:59.010
Ja-ko!

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.160
<i>Oh, my goodness!</i>

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.930
<i>This is all because I didn't stop them.</i>

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:30.850
<i>It turned into this really funny thing!</i>

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:34.800
<i>I knew how Ryou-chan gets 
when she's drunk, and yet...</i>

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:38.620
<i>I'm an idiot! An idiot!</i>

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.920
<i>A failure of an adult!</i>

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:46.410
<b>Craft
Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:55.390
Ow, ow, ow, ow.

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.500
Where am I?

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:08.620
Landlord?!

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:12.360
Ow, what the hell're you doing?

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:15.410
Why am I sleeping next to you?

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.740
And why are my clothes gone?

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.200
What the hell is this?

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:23.080
What are you doing in my bed?

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.090
That's what I'd like to know!

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:25.580
We're not even in a bed, though.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.370
Good morning!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:30.660
You two fell asleep on the 
floor like two drunk besties.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:32.340
